WEBVTT

00:06.400 --> 00:08.820
Clarin, are you sure you can do this without an arm?

00:08.820 --> 00:10.030
No problem.

00:10.030 --> 00:11.780
It won't even be a handicap.

00:11.780 --> 00:15.290
Together, Nene and Clarion can do anything.

00:15.290 --> 00:16.000
Yeah!

00:19.120 --> 00:20.460
Think you can open it?

00:20.460 --> 00:21.710
Before long, sir.

00:21.710 --> 00:22.420
Hurry.

00:22.420 --> 00:23.380
Yes, sir.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.380
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:28.220 --> 00:29.470
What's this place!?

00:29.470 --> 00:31.390
Some kind of research facility?

00:31.390 --> 00:33.350
It's a scoop, obvious!

00:33.350 --> 00:34.560
No, not yet!

00:34.560 --> 00:36.810
This isn't nearly enough!

00:37.770 --> 00:39.730
I just heard something...

00:39.730 --> 00:40.850
This is it!

00:40.850 --> 00:42.770
I'll put my life on the line for this scoop!

00:42.770 --> 00:45.280
In the name of love, I am Vli—

00:46.530 --> 00:49.900
We'll show you what true fear is all about.

00:50.490 --> 00:52.410
I know fear already.

00:52.410 --> 00:55.410
Fear, you have my permission. Exterminate them.

00:55.410 --> 00:57.120
Don't leave a single trace.

01:14.510 --> 01:16.560
You don't amount to fear.

01:17.680 --> 01:18.810
Impossible...

01:18.810 --> 01:21.730
Optical and pressure sensors are functioning normally!

01:21.730 --> 01:23.560
No problems with the audio sensors, either!

01:23.560 --> 01:24.810
They're all the real thing!

01:25.520 --> 01:27.900
It didn't have such an ability before...

01:28.650 --> 01:29.320
It's <i>that</i> one.

01:30.490 --> 01:33.740
If Clarin's with me, I'm not afraid of anything!

01:34.410 --> 01:38.790
It's fooling every eye in this base, all by itself...

01:39.700 --> 01:42.210
Fear, Code 210.

01:48.760 --> 01:52.180
If he can't make out the real one, he'll simply wipe them all out.

01:52.680 --> 01:55.430
Now he won't stop until the battle is over.

01:56.430 --> 01:59.310
Two percent remaining until we break through BUER's barriers!

01:59.310 --> 02:00.560
At last.

02:00.560 --> 02:03.140
It's all coming along!

02:03.140 --> 02:06.230
The barriers Uzal built are truly the strongest in the world.

02:06.230 --> 02:08.570
I don't even think someone at wizard rank could get through.

02:09.070 --> 02:09.820
However!

02:10.360 --> 02:13.360
<i>I'll</i> get through, just you watch!

02:14.320 --> 02:15.740
This'll finish it!

02:16.160 --> 02:17.910
Final barrier, penetrated!

02:17.910 --> 02:20.240
We have complete control of BUER's mainframe!

02:20.240 --> 02:22.960
Reveal yourself, BUER!

02:26.630 --> 02:27.420
What?

02:38.140 --> 02:39.600
I've waited so long.

02:40.100 --> 02:42.350
Finally, the time has come.

02:45.810 --> 02:46.600
Who goes there?

02:47.020 --> 02:51.610
We are a multinational corporate complex.

02:51.610 --> 02:56.700
An organization formed to save all of mankind.

02:56.700 --> 02:58.870
Our name is...

03:00.330 --> 03:01.830
Poseidon!

03:03.120 --> 03:07.210
Even they are nothing more than fodder for my ideals.

03:07.210 --> 03:09.630
Everything will be mine!

03:19.930 --> 03:20.760
Don't bother.

03:25.350 --> 03:27.600
Sahar Schehera, the genius,

03:27.600 --> 03:32.190
I will inherit your legacy,
and you shall be a hero, a legend.

03:34.240 --> 03:38.280
Once I obtain this superweapon,
the world peace we desire will—

03:38.280 --> 03:40.740
Stop right there, little one.

03:41.700 --> 03:42.950
I am BUER.

03:43.540 --> 03:50.080
A philosopher of hell who possesses the five legs of the goat, the head of the lion, and eternal wisdom.

03:50.080 --> 03:53.590
BUER's Central Nervous Unit!

03:54.210 --> 03:57.220
BUER, I intend to release you.

03:57.220 --> 03:58.680
Thou hadst best not.

03:58.680 --> 04:00.140
Thou wilt regret it.

04:00.140 --> 04:03.010
Do it, unlock access.

04:03.010 --> 04:06.350
And at that moment, BUER will be mine!

04:07.850 --> 04:09.520
Clarin! Your weapons!

04:18.950 --> 04:19.910
Clarin!

04:21.410 --> 04:22.580
There.

04:30.630 --> 04:32.380
Nene, don't be so reckless.

04:32.380 --> 04:33.840
Thank goodness!

04:35.510 --> 04:36.510
Clarin!

04:37.720 --> 04:39.720
I'm going to protect Clarin!

04:39.720 --> 04:41.890
I won't let you hurt her!

04:49.850 --> 04:52.150
Nene, I have a trump card.

04:52.150 --> 04:53.110
Ten seconds.

04:53.110 --> 04:54.400
Buy me that time.

04:54.400 --> 04:55.320
All right!

05:03.200 --> 05:04.450
Even if it doesn't do much!

05:04.450 --> 05:07.410
Six... Seven... Eight...

05:12.380 --> 05:13.500
Gertsecomma!

05:15.040 --> 05:15.880
Ten.

05:15.880 --> 05:19.050
Plasma Cat Punch!

05:24.140 --> 05:25.810
Wow!

05:35.110 --> 05:36.190
Clarin!

05:40.820 --> 05:41.820
Wait!

05:41.820 --> 05:43.820
Thou wilt seriously regret it!

05:44.160 --> 05:45.320
Nay, verily!

05:45.660 --> 05:47.160
Thou mustn't! Nay!

05:47.160 --> 05:49.250
Nay, I say!

05:50.250 --> 05:54.960
N-Nay!

06:08.890 --> 06:10.430
Now, BUER!

06:10.430 --> 06:12.230
Purify the old world!

06:12.230 --> 06:13.730
The worthless ones.

06:14.020 --> 06:15.350
The sins of the old and foolish!

06:15.900 --> 06:18.110
Use your hellish power!

06:26.870 --> 06:28.200
What's that?

06:52.640 --> 06:54.390
Huh? Is that me?

06:54.390 --> 06:55.900
Oh, Clarin's there too.

06:55.900 --> 06:58.150
What the hell is this!?

06:58.150 --> 06:59.360
I need to get rid of this!

06:59.360 --> 07:01.110
KOM System operational limit reached.

07:01.110 --> 07:02.610
Executing forced termination.

07:02.610 --> 07:04.990
Thank you for using the system.

07:04.990 --> 07:07.660
Hey, wait a minute!

07:22.000 --> 07:24.380
'Tis a tragedy!

07:24.380 --> 07:27.430
My lascivious thigh pics!

07:27.430 --> 07:31.510
They have been leaked to all of the world!

07:32.720 --> 07:33.770
Thigh...

07:33.770 --> 07:35.770
...Images?

07:35.770 --> 07:39.110
You son of a whore!

07:39.810 --> 07:42.480
PC data, you know!?

07:42.480 --> 07:45.650
That which even one's own <i>parents</i> must never see!

07:48.780 --> 07:51.200
I like thighs!

07:51.780 --> 07:54.450
And I like flat chests!

07:54.450 --> 07:57.420
And I love regular breasts!

07:57.420 --> 08:00.170
And of course I <i>adore</i> buxom breasts!

08:00.170 --> 08:02.550
Those boobies, how they jiggle!

08:02.550 --> 08:08.300
Wasn't I going to gain control of BUER
if I broke through its attack barriers?

08:10.010 --> 08:11.050
What sayest thou?

08:11.390 --> 08:15.060
All ye broke into was mine folder of booty.

08:16.060 --> 08:19.560
Not a single bit hath penetrated the core!

08:21.110 --> 08:26.110
Ganging up and hacking into my meager bit of happiness...

08:26.110 --> 08:27.110
'Tis cruel...

08:27.110 --> 08:28.860
All too cruel!

08:28.860 --> 08:30.360
Shut up!

08:30.950 --> 08:34.120
My plan... was flawless...

08:34.910 --> 08:40.250
I pretended to obey those feeble-minded monkeys... all for an outcome like <i>this</i>!?

08:40.250 --> 08:41.750
I put up with those incompetent subordinates.

08:42.420 --> 08:44.250
My time...

08:44.250 --> 08:46.170
My ideals...

08:46.170 --> 08:48.220
All <i>wasted</i>?

08:48.220 --> 08:51.220
That absolutely must not be!

08:55.600 --> 08:57.560
'Tis over!

08:57.560 --> 08:58.930
All of it!

08:59.390 --> 09:01.810
'Tis all over!

09:02.310 --> 09:03.400
BUER...

09:10.650 --> 09:14.070
I shall destroy everything, and then myself!

09:24.380 --> 09:28.050
Had I known, I would have gotten that girl to unlock this too!

09:29.130 --> 09:30.340
What!? What!?

09:33.470 --> 09:34.140
Girls!

09:34.140 --> 09:35.220
You came for us!

09:35.220 --> 09:36.350
We knew you would!

09:39.020 --> 09:44.480
In the end, the American Empire and I
were all just playing into Uzal's hand...

09:44.480 --> 09:46.360
I wouldn't say that.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.730
Hi there!

09:47.730 --> 09:49.280
Uzal!

09:49.280 --> 09:51.400
What have you been doing!?

09:51.400 --> 09:52.610
That can wait.

09:52.610 --> 09:55.120
Right now, let's focus on Nene and Clarion.

09:55.830 --> 09:57.030
Nene?

09:59.120 --> 10:00.450
Thanks.

10:01.870 --> 10:04.040
Nene, evacuate to the surface.

10:04.040 --> 10:05.250
It's dangerous here.

10:05.250 --> 10:06.880
Then let's go together, Clarin.

10:06.880 --> 10:07.920
I can't.

10:08.590 --> 10:10.800
BUER has gone totally berserk.

10:10.800 --> 10:12.510
I have to stop it.

10:13.510 --> 10:15.470
Then we'll do it together, like last time!

10:15.470 --> 10:17.890
The circumstances are different this time around.

10:18.640 --> 10:20.060
Uzal!

10:20.060 --> 10:21.980
Hi, Nene. It's been a while.

10:21.980 --> 10:23.890
I just knew you were safe!

10:23.890 --> 10:26.900
Sorry to push so much trouble off on you.

10:27.820 --> 10:30.530
And pardon me for doing this from a bit of a distance.

10:30.530 --> 10:31.650
Nene!

10:31.650 --> 10:32.900
T-Takumi!

10:32.900 --> 10:35.870
Why do you go running off like this!?

10:35.870 --> 10:38.490
I thought for sure you were still in your room!

10:38.490 --> 10:39.790
I-I'm sorry!

10:39.790 --> 10:42.910
I just wanted to help Clarin, no matter what!

10:43.750 --> 10:46.420
But let's focus on BUER right now.

10:46.420 --> 10:48.920
What do you mean the situation is different?

10:48.920 --> 10:53.800
When Nene and the others stopped it last time,
its rampage was a defensive mechanism.

10:53.800 --> 10:58.640
But in the case of this rampage, it's been
integrated with its Central Nervous Unit.

10:58.640 --> 11:01.270
Um, how is that different?

11:01.270 --> 11:05.690
You could say that it's angry from the bottom of its heart.

11:05.690 --> 11:08.020
It can no longer be stopped from the outside.

11:08.020 --> 11:11.690
I shall reduce everything to ashes!

11:11.690 --> 11:14.070
When will its battery run out?

11:14.070 --> 11:17.110
There's a huge amount of electrical power stored up in there.

11:17.110 --> 11:20.490
This island will probably be vaporized before it stops running.

11:20.490 --> 11:21.240
What!?

11:21.240 --> 11:23.330
You've got no room to talk when it's partly your fault.

11:32.960 --> 11:35.050
I-Is there a way to stop it?

11:35.760 --> 11:37.050
Technically, yes.

11:37.050 --> 11:40.550
The very last in a line of final measures.

11:41.430 --> 11:42.810
It's Clarion.

11:43.140 --> 11:43.930
Clarin?

11:47.270 --> 11:51.820
Clarion also functions as a key to make
BUER self-destruct from the inside.

11:53.070 --> 11:54.070
Any luck!?

11:54.070 --> 11:55.030
No, none.

11:55.030 --> 11:56.110
I'm putting it into play.

11:57.070 --> 11:58.820
C-Colonel!?

12:00.320 --> 12:02.280
Clarin is the key?

12:02.280 --> 12:06.750
I see. So the real storage key was the puppet.

12:07.540 --> 12:11.340
Um... In that case, what will happen to Clarin?

12:11.340 --> 12:12.460
What about BUER?

12:12.460 --> 12:14.710
This is the shrewd Uzal we're talking about.

12:15.340 --> 12:18.800
I assume it destroys both of them without a trace.

12:18.800 --> 12:19.970
Am I wrong?

12:20.550 --> 12:21.850
Right on the mark.

12:23.140 --> 12:24.220
No!

12:24.220 --> 12:26.520
No! No, no!

12:26.520 --> 12:28.600
Not a chance!

12:28.600 --> 12:29.940
I refuse!

12:29.940 --> 12:31.400
But Nene, it's the only—

12:31.400 --> 12:32.860
Shut up, Takumi!

12:32.860 --> 12:33.360
Yes, ma'am!

12:33.940 --> 12:36.110
I'm Clarin's owner!

12:36.110 --> 12:38.530
I'll never let something like that happen!

12:39.740 --> 12:40.660
Nene.

12:40.660 --> 12:45.450
This entire island is doomed at this rate, and you along with it.

12:45.450 --> 12:47.500
All the people you care about.

12:47.500 --> 12:49.330
B-But...

12:50.460 --> 12:51.250
Nene.

12:51.790 --> 12:55.550
This may sound cold-hearted, but you don't have a choice.

12:55.550 --> 12:58.760
The puppet came here prepared for this.

13:02.220 --> 13:03.260
Clarin...

13:03.970 --> 13:06.180
Are <i>you</i> okay with this?

13:06.180 --> 13:10.730
If it is the only way to protect Nene,
Clarion does not mind.

13:10.730 --> 13:14.770
Being protected like <i>this</i> doesn't make me happy at all!

13:15.570 --> 13:17.900
You're seriously okay with this, Clarin?

13:19.320 --> 13:20.700
You'll die!

13:21.320 --> 13:24.830
You'll never get to... see me again.

13:25.660 --> 13:28.750
Even so, Nene's safety is the top priority.

13:28.750 --> 13:31.000
I don't want this, Clarin!

13:33.330 --> 13:37.300
We haven't even gone shopping together like we promised!

13:37.880 --> 13:39.920
Are you crying, Nene?

13:39.920 --> 13:41.550
Of course I am!

13:43.590 --> 13:46.180
Actually, there is one more key.

13:47.510 --> 13:50.430
It could wind up an even more risky gamble...

13:50.980 --> 13:54.190
but do you wanna give it a shot, Nanakorobi Nene?

13:57.900 --> 13:59.230
Colonel, this is inadvisable!

13:59.230 --> 14:01.950
The legs are only 80% complete!

14:01.950 --> 14:04.530
I thought I told you the legs are just for show!

14:04.530 --> 14:06.080
Why don't you understand that?

14:09.450 --> 14:10.370
I'll do it.

14:10.370 --> 14:12.040
Nene!

14:12.040 --> 14:16.340
I mean, it's the best way for everyone to get a happy ending.

14:16.340 --> 14:17.800
But this plan is awful!

14:17.800 --> 14:19.960
Yep, I thought you'd say that!

14:20.300 --> 14:23.050
Okay Clarion, use the Pandora Device so Nene can—

14:23.050 --> 14:24.010
I refuse.

14:26.300 --> 14:29.600
And I demand this plan be canceled.

14:30.270 --> 14:31.230
<i>Oh?</i>

14:32.140 --> 14:35.650
<i>Clarion's never disobeyed my orders before.</i>

14:36.560 --> 14:38.860
It's okay, Clarin.

14:39.400 --> 14:41.030
Have you forgotten already?

14:41.030 --> 14:45.200
I can do anything if I'm with you.

14:45.200 --> 14:46.280
Nene...

14:46.280 --> 14:49.280
So, please help me out.

14:51.540 --> 14:53.620
I swear I'll come back.

14:54.460 --> 14:56.420
Pandora Device, open!

15:01.380 --> 15:04.090
Release skill, Storage Key!

15:10.310 --> 15:11.560
Hurry, hurry!

15:19.270 --> 15:20.940
Well, I'll be back!

15:20.940 --> 15:23.690
Off I go!

15:28.410 --> 15:29.950
Puppet!

15:32.370 --> 15:33.700
In there.

15:36.330 --> 15:40.210
I don't know what you intend to do,
but I won't let you!

15:52.100 --> 15:52.890
Clarin!

15:53.390 --> 15:56.270
I'll destroy you along with BUER!

15:58.270 --> 15:59.770
Out of ammo?

16:00.230 --> 16:01.520
Hurry, before it closes.

16:03.190 --> 16:03.900
What!?

16:05.610 --> 16:06.740
The leg!

16:07.360 --> 16:09.110
Now, Nene. Go.

16:09.110 --> 16:10.370
Okay!

16:12.780 --> 16:13.830
No, you don't!

16:14.620 --> 16:17.160
Um, thank you!

16:26.220 --> 16:27.300
Up ahead...

16:32.430 --> 16:33.640
Nene!

16:35.850 --> 16:37.640
That must be it.

16:43.480 --> 16:44.440
BUER.

16:45.860 --> 16:47.570
Please, BUER.

16:47.570 --> 16:49.320
Don't be so angry.

16:49.320 --> 16:51.530
But... But...

16:51.530 --> 16:54.030
They all saw those images...

16:54.030 --> 16:55.620
And now, now I'm...

16:55.620 --> 16:58.660
There's no shame in that.

16:58.660 --> 16:59.670
'Tis a lie!

16:59.670 --> 17:01.580
You lie!

17:02.130 --> 17:03.420
It's true.

17:03.420 --> 17:07.920
In fact, those images were great.

17:07.920 --> 17:09.420
They were a work of art.

17:15.430 --> 17:16.600
It's no use!

17:16.600 --> 17:17.850
It's not stopping!

17:17.850 --> 17:18.930
Nene is...!

17:20.600 --> 17:22.440
That's why I said the legs were for show!

17:25.520 --> 17:26.190
What!?

17:31.410 --> 17:32.200
Nene!

17:53.510 --> 17:55.970
Nene... Nene!

17:56.560 --> 17:57.760
What's wrong, Nene?

17:59.100 --> 18:00.230
Answer me.

18:04.690 --> 18:05.610
Freeze!

18:06.360 --> 18:08.230
This base is under our control!

18:08.230 --> 18:11.950
What do you want, you CDF imbeciles?

18:11.950 --> 18:13.410
Ian Kurtz!

18:13.410 --> 18:16.740
You're being detained for suspicion of
involvement in the Cenancle terrorist incident!

18:16.740 --> 18:18.330
Are you insane, Captain?

18:18.330 --> 18:21.830
If your island's military stirs up trouble with our empire—

18:21.830 --> 18:24.290
We are no longer a military.

18:24.290 --> 18:27.750
As of yesterday we are a newly established judicial organ...

18:27.750 --> 18:30.010
...the Cenancle Police Department!

18:31.210 --> 18:35.510
You've been stripped of your military rank, so now you're just a criminal.

18:35.510 --> 18:39.010
I see, you set this all up.

18:39.390 --> 18:42.560
How did that youngster find out I'd taken bribes!?

18:42.560 --> 18:43.270
What!?

18:43.270 --> 18:45.230
You bunch of worthless pawns!

18:51.070 --> 18:52.940
Ian Kurtz!

18:52.940 --> 18:55.410
In the name of justice, you're under arrest!

18:56.660 --> 18:57.740
A mysterious facility!

18:57.740 --> 18:58.830
Mysterious robots!

18:58.830 --> 19:03.000
And what else, but a big mysterious sphere!

19:03.000 --> 19:06.210
We're moments away from the unraveling of this mystery.

19:06.210 --> 19:09.840
Brought to you by none other than the idol reporter, Vli—

19:12.300 --> 19:13.130
Nene...

19:13.840 --> 19:14.800
Come back...

19:15.680 --> 19:17.800
Aren't we going to go shopping?

19:20.470 --> 19:21.140
Nene...

19:22.680 --> 19:24.850
Call me "Clarin" again...

19:31.150 --> 19:33.900
O maiden with the jet-black ears.

19:35.610 --> 19:40.620
The request of a pure maiden hath calmed mine anger.

19:41.330 --> 19:47.370
As thanks for rescuing me from the depths
of despair, I shall grant thee thy request.

19:47.710 --> 19:49.920
State now thy one desire.

19:51.170 --> 19:54.420
I desire... only one thing.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.390
Nanakorobi Nene!

20:10.810 --> 20:11.650
Nene!

20:13.730 --> 20:14.860
Huh?

20:14.860 --> 20:15.990
Clarin?

20:16.990 --> 20:18.160
Good morning!

20:23.700 --> 20:25.580
What will become of BUER?

20:25.580 --> 20:29.420
I'll sink it to the bottom of the sea, so nobody can get to it.

20:30.040 --> 20:34.880
It probably still needs an enormous amount
of time to form its own sense of self.

20:35.550 --> 20:38.760
I suppose the first phase of the experiment was a success.

20:38.760 --> 20:39.550
Experiment?

20:39.550 --> 20:40.930
What experiment?

20:42.550 --> 20:44.100
That's still a secret.

20:44.100 --> 20:46.140
Man, you piss me off!

20:46.140 --> 20:47.430
Korobase.

20:47.850 --> 20:52.440
Thank you for protecting Elpis—Nene and Clarion.

20:53.730 --> 20:56.360
Elpis... "Hope"?

20:56.360 --> 20:57.190
Then...

20:57.190 --> 21:00.950
Those two were the true key to BUER!

21:01.780 --> 21:03.120
Hey!

21:03.120 --> 21:05.240
Oh, Bunny! And everyone else!

21:05.240 --> 21:09.330
As you can see, thanks to you guys,
we're all free now!

21:10.120 --> 21:11.500
Another tremor?

21:11.500 --> 21:13.080
This is an emergency!

21:13.080 --> 21:15.250
Uzal left a message!

21:15.250 --> 21:17.380
Get your asses out of here, girls!

21:17.380 --> 21:18.550
Sahar!

21:18.550 --> 21:22.840
Ol' Uzal plans to completely seal off this geofront!

21:26.180 --> 21:27.970
Everyone, please hurry!

21:27.970 --> 21:29.520
This again!?

21:30.190 --> 21:33.270
Evacuate as quickly as possible!

21:34.940 --> 21:35.980
Halt!

21:35.980 --> 21:37.280
Kurtz!

21:39.570 --> 21:42.490
<i>I haven't realized my ideal world!</i>

21:42.820 --> 21:44.740
<i>This can't be over yet!</i>

21:47.950 --> 21:49.000
So you're...

21:49.700 --> 21:51.580
Sahar Schehera!

22:04.720 --> 22:06.350
We made it!

22:07.390 --> 22:08.600
So it seemeth.

22:08.600 --> 22:10.180
BUER!

22:10.180 --> 22:11.310
I retrieved him.

22:15.860 --> 22:23.610
And that's how our long, long day finally came to an end.

22:28.450 --> 22:30.080
See you later!

22:31.120 --> 22:33.960
Things are still a bit of a mess in town!

22:33.960 --> 22:35.420
Be careful!

22:35.420 --> 22:36.710
Yes, ma'am!

22:36.710 --> 22:38.090
Let's go, Clarin.

22:38.880 --> 22:43.680
She pulled off such an amazing feat,
but she still needs to be baby-sat like this...

22:46.970 --> 22:49.560
Why did we end up like this?

22:49.560 --> 22:54.310
I took charge of you, so you better work hard!

22:54.310 --> 22:56.230
Yes, ma'am!

22:58.440 --> 22:59.980
Shopping with Clarin?

22:59.980 --> 23:01.610
And with tiny thingy, too?

23:01.610 --> 23:03.110
I am a demon king!

23:03.530 --> 23:04.240
Nene!

23:04.610 --> 23:07.070
Robert! Are you helping out?

23:08.070 --> 23:09.240
It's my nature!

23:10.330 --> 23:14.040
So many unbelievable events
happened here on Cenancle Island!

23:14.040 --> 23:18.380
We managed to get the whole thing on camera!

23:18.380 --> 23:21.210
I'm the one who dared to get the inside story!

23:21.210 --> 23:23.840
The future star reporter, Vli—

23:23.840 --> 23:25.470
And now, for our next story...

23:24.220 --> 23:27.640
I hope we find what you want soon.

23:29.470 --> 23:30.760
I already found it.

23:31.890 --> 23:34.100
Really!? What is it!?

23:34.100 --> 23:35.100
It's...

23:35.100 --> 23:35.770
Yes!?

23:35.770 --> 23:37.270
...sufficiently gay!

23:37.980 --> 23:38.940
A secret.

23:38.940 --> 23:41.020
Ahhh, that's no fair!

23:41.020 --> 23:43.780
I'll tell you if you achieve world peace.

23:43.780 --> 23:44.780
Really!?

23:44.780 --> 23:46.280
It's a promise then.

23:48.530 --> 23:53.080
Okay! So today, we'll keep working toward world peace!

23:53.080 --> 23:56.540
One, two! Yeah!
